---
import { site } from "../../lib/site-config";
---

<section
  id="manifesto"
  class="relative overflow-hidden border-y border-border bg-surface-inverse px-5 py-24 text-background md:px-8 md:py-32"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <p class="reveal font-mono text-[0.75rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-background/55">
      {site.name} · {site.city}
    </p>

    <h2 class="statement reveal mt-7 max-w-4xl">
      Solo hago <strong>microblading</strong>
    </h2>

    <p class="reveal mt-8 max-w-xl text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-background/75">
      Trabajo en {site.city}, de una en una. Antes de pigmentar miro tu piel, tu vello
      y tu rostro. Si el microblading no encaja, te lo digo en la valoración.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
